4:09:13Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in 4.3.stable\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.3.stable - Linux Mint 21.3 (Virginia) - X11 - Vulkan (Forward+) - integrated Intel(R) HD Graphics 620 (KBL GT2) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-7200U CPU @ 2.50GHz (4 Threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nThe native file dialog grays out all folders when i enable `Use Native Dialog` and set the file mode to `Open Folder`\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/01aa4861-76ef-4681-8a09-d8dafe2bf706)\n\nfrom my tests, it seems to happen only in `Open Folder` mode and for me the initial directory is ALWAYS `/home/{username}` regardless of the mode i chose in `Access`.\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- make a new project.\n- add a Filedialog to the scene.\n- enable `Use Native Dialog` and set **File Mode** to `Open Folder`\n- popup the dialog when you run the scene\n\nFor detailed steps see the video below:\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f40cbea6-50f4-41e5-99af-e76d92e45ecd\n\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[dialogtest.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/17893265/dialogtest.zip)\n","closed_by":{"login":"Variable-ind","id":77773850,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3NzczODUw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/77773850?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Variable-ind","html_url":"https://github.com/Variable-ind","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Variable-ind/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Variable-ind/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Variable-ind/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Variable-ind/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions